                          "font-weight": "400",
                          "width": "var(--container-widget-width,78%)",
                          "max-width": "78%",
                          "--container-widget-width": "78%"
                        }
                      },
                      "type": "text",
                      "html": "<p>Nava Wilson LLP is a Toronto-based law firm with a strong focus on Real Estate that has been recognized as one of the top 10 law firms in Ontario for the past decade by First Canadian Title Insurance. We provide services in Real Estate, Immigration, Corporate Law, Litigation, and Wills and Estates, and have a strong commitment to making the justice system more accessible and understood. We aim to empower our clients and communities by helping them understand their legal rights and responsibilities.</p><p><br>Legal procedures can be complex, but we strive to simplify them and ensure they are transparent for everyone involved. In addition to our client work, we actively engage in advocacy and capacity-building efforts, both locally and globally, to drive positive change and inspire future generations. Looking forward to working with you!</p>"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
